 RSS 或来源节选，不代表原文全文。请以原始来源为准。","title":"[AINews] Gemini 4 Neon: GDM's Opus/Sol Contender"},{"associated_observations":1,"id":"evt_77766f45c9266a4dcc8f24d34866268194cdf083dbc3d6ae1cef3ce8507925d3","internal_url":"/posts/20261119-blogs_podcasts-how-airbnb-uses-cost-per-task-to-operate-coding-ag-0-02a9f081f7/","observation_id":"obs_02a9f081f7220770d133b5928d994e7885fa25ce0b6eff6c1d405f4bdfe338d0","published_at":"2026-11-18T21:48:19Z","related_reports":[],"relation":"original","source":"blogs_podcasts","summary":"Airbnb 介绍了如何用真实工程任务评测编码代理模型，并通过 Amazon Bedrock 和 Amazon CloudWatch 持续监控生产表现。核心依据是每项任务成本，同时关注延迟、限流和 token 消耗。","title":"How Airbnb uses cost per task to operate coding agents on Amazon Bedrock"},{"associated_observations":1,"id":"evt_c494d2f950725add78e5ac9d0efcf0bf1fc10ec6af034b14b90c908013ec93bb","internal_url":"/posts/20261120-arxiv-knowing-what-you-know-a-trait-theory-of-reviewer-v-0-9414947fea/","observation_id":"obs_9414947fea04778a1da2a02a7792e341671207fa6e9840f40c066c3ff9a02268","published_at":"2026-11-18T18:55:07Z","related_reports":[],"relation":"original","source":"arxiv","summary":"这篇论文提出“评审者价值”理论：人机共同决策时，人类能否持续创造价值，关键在于其信心与判断正确率是否匹配，即元认知校准。论文结合 AI 辅助会计系统六个月的生产数据，对该理论及其边界进行分析。","title":"Knowing What You Know: A Trait Theory of Reviewer Value in Human-AI Cognitive Systems"},{"associated_observations":1,"id":"evt_1b92b6a5b5a4e3a75354136cb1383cf4a613d6896b05d2ff1d58043148f1ca63","internal_url":"/posts/20261119-arxiv-rsibench-infra-can-agents-optimize-their-own-train-0-8c79a09d70/","observation_id":"obs_8c79a09d70d62ee0814db31ff9e3de6e1393ced1da7b00a3a2357c1f6648181c","published_at":"2026-11-18T13:29:44Z","related_reports":[],"relation":"original","source":"arxiv","summary":"RSIBench-Infra 是面向生产级训练与推理优化的基准，包含20项任务，允许代理跨引擎、内核和指令层修改软件栈。评测在任务质量约束下衡量端到端性能，并使用 OCI 镜像层协议记录改动以便复现部署。","title":"RSIBench-Infra: Can Agents Optimize Their Own Training and Inference Infrastructure at Production Scale?"},{"associated_observations":1,"id":"evt_ff1bb866f4c19670002813834d