27Z","related_reports":[],"relation":"original","source":"arxiv","summary":"Spool 是一种免训练的低延迟流式推理框架，面向结合注意力层与线性循环层的混合视觉语言模型。它缓存各帧对应的状态变换并高效组合，使滑动窗口前移时无需重跑整个视频窗口即可移除过期帧。","title":"Spool: Low-Latency Streaming Inference for Hybrid Vision-Language Models"},{"associated_observations":1,"id":"evt_96f16237b93437092e384182e56844a990c058771f9aa864a6b1e20d0e03ace8","internal_url":"/posts/20261119-arxiv-stringqft-a-multiuse-textbook-resource-for-ai-assi-0-d0ceadb35a/","observation_id":"obs_d0ceadb35a8be6494e8d0d2df622c13809de66743d5046d06677fab2619bdb38","published_at":"2026-11-17T18:58:40Z","related_reports":[],"relation":"original","source":"arxiv","summary":"当前保存的是来源摘要，不代表论文全文。请以原始来源为准。","title":"StringQFT: A Multiuse Textbook Resource for AI-Assisted Theoretical Physics"},{"associated_observations":1,"id":"evt_4c2e0493d2b998a7879df2151f9ac8f4f44732d32cb8c034aca75c0fc46f1366","internal_url":"/posts/20261117-blogs_podcasts-ainews-perplexity-hits-a-1b-revenue-run-rate-up-4x-0-c2b6352c27/","observation_id":"obs_c2b6352c27cb01c4de0b5aa7f96be2b7b1572fff9becd4055f886b8d802f7df1","published_at":"2026-11-17T09:24:56Z","related_reports":[],"relation":"original","source":"blogs_podcasts","summary":"这期 AI 行业简报重点关注 Perplexity 年化收入突破 10 亿美元及估值变化，同时汇总 Qwen4-Max、模型安全评估、智能体基础设施和推理性能等进展。","title":"[AINews] Perplexity hits a $1B revenue run rate, up 4x in 2026"},{"associated_observations":1,"id":"evt_342ec10531c58204b086eae6971f5e0c192a63ca391c63e22b5eb1d471082ae8","internal_url":"/posts/20261117-hacker_news-windows-11-is-collecting-data-on-which-coding-agen-1-d586dccccf/","observation_id":"obs_d586dccccf61f0412017c4f74a54d8687b67c037cc7a2ae00dffc718d2fa0866","published_at":"2026-11-16T22:58:20Z","related_reports":[],"relation":"original","source":"hacker_news","summary":"当前只保存了标题与来源元数据，未抓取外链全文。请以原始来源和 Hacker News 讨论为准。","title":"Windows 11 Is Collecting Data on Which Coding Agents and Developer Tools You Use"},{"associated_observations":1,"id":"evt_319b25ba2c0eeac770f0c2fe4598a32101d72d351f