-nativel-2-084301ebd6/","observation_id":"obs_084301ebd6f9e5a465f93c04978347e6359694c288d5461e34fa2decd9106f92","published_at":"2026-11-13T18:59:02Z","related_reports":[],"relation":"original","source":"arxiv","summary":"这项研究提出 PEAR，通过机器人使用强化学习（RURL），仅在仿真环境中、无需示范数据地训练 27B 开源权重推理模型，使其能够直接为真实机器人生成末端执行器位姿。","title":"Training Reasoning Models in Simulation to Natively Use Real Robots"},{"associated_observations":1,"id":"evt_d813703d1d8ece00b1f84a28c4d64c52eb55108d62f16571603bde9fc01ecaca","internal_url":"/posts/20261114-blogs_podcasts-introducing-chatgpt-wallet-0-7d4d71d056/","observation_id":"obs_7d4d71d056da02862d0b2ec1b87dadd7019731481c576401840bf8ff718ee663","published_at":"2026-11-13T15:00:00Z","related_reports":[],"relation":"original","source":"blogs_podcasts","summary":"当前保存的是 RSS 或来源节选，不代表原文全文。请以原始来源为准。","title":"Introducing ChatGPT Wallet"},{"associated_observations":1,"id":"evt_3ef71bf30bbf1eb5c3cf423bddacd2d7b0c4cd80dae9f6ba8fd1f3ac680f837f","internal_url":"/posts/20261114-arxiv-internalizing-investment-mandates-a-neurosymbolic--0-abcecd6333/","observation_id":"obs_abcecd6333f5ed1bdbe0e7085d07e9646945ccac172ebdf75fc1cf1a93e35680","published_at":"2026-11-12T18:59:37Z","related_reports":[],"relation":"original","source":"arxiv","summary":"论文将可微分的符号逻辑监督引入连续资产配置，使智能体在学习过程中掌握投资政策声明的约束，而非在执行后补救违规。实验显示，在六条随市场状态变化的规则下，违规率明显低于无约束强化学习和奖励惩罚方法。","title":"Internalizing Investment Mandates: A Neurosymbolic RL Approach to Portfolio Allocation"}],"graph_node_id":"tag:AI Agent","id":"tag:AI Agent","related_topics":[{"cooccurrence":28,"graph_node_id":"tag:大语言模型","id":"tag:大语言模型","jaccard":0.5,"topic":"大语言模型"},{"cooccurrence":16,"graph_node_id":"tag:Prompt 工程","id":"tag:Prompt 工程","jaccard":0.285714,"topic":"Prompt 工程"},{"cooccurrence":12,"graph_node_id":"tag:机器学习","id":"tag:机器学习","jaccard":0.214286,"topic":"机器学习"},{"cooccurrence":11,"graph_node_id":"tag:生成式 AI","id":"tag:生成式 AI","jaccard":0.196429,"topic":"生成式 AI"},{"cooccurrence":7,"graph_node_id":"tag:Advanced (300)","id":"